<Base title="Terms" description="Terms of use for AI Veterinary and pet-passport accounts.">
  <article class="wrap narrow hero prose">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="notice warn">Draft. To be completed with the company details and reviewed before accounts open.</p>

    <h2>What this is</h2>
    <p>AI Veterinary (aiveterinary.org) is run by <strong>[Company name], [address]</strong>. It provides general animal-health information, a digital pet passport you keep yourself, and, for veterinary professionals, documentation tools.</p>

    <h2>Not veterinary advice</h2>
    <p>Nothing on this site is a diagnosis, a prescription or a substitute for examination by a veterinarian. Articles are general information, reviewed by veterinarians where marked, and cannot take your animal's situation into account. In an emergency contact a veterinary clinic.</p>

    <h2>The digital pet passport</h2>
    <p>The passport is a convenience copy that you fill in and are responsible for. It is not an official document and does not replace the EU pet passport or any certificate issued by a veterinarian or authority. Check important details (vaccination dates, microchip number) against the official documents.</p>

    <h2>Accounts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You must be at least 16 and give a working email address.</li>
      <li>Keep your email account secure; the login link goes there.</li>
      <li>Enter only information about animals you own or care for, and only contact details of people who agree.</li>
      <li>You can export and delete your data at any time. See the <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a>.</li>
      <li>The service is provided free of charge and as it is. We work to keep it available and your data safe, but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted availability. Keep a backup of anything important.</li>
      <li>We may close accounts used for abuse, and may end the service with 60 days' notice by email, during which you can export your data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for loss arising from reliance on information on this site, from unavailability of the service, or from loss of data you have not backed up. Nothing limits liability for intent or gross negligence, or for injury to life, body or health.</p>

    <h2>Law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the law of [country]. Consumers keep the protections of the law of their country of residence.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
